    <h1>Hendrix Advancement: About Page</h1>
    <hr class="hr" />
</h1>
<section class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-6">
            <h2>About The Advancement Office</h2>
            <p>The Advancement Office handles all of the gifts and funding that comes from willing doners. We are greatful for
                whatever you have to offer to the continued prosperity of Hendrix. We understand that there are a lot of questions and queries
                regarding the process of making a donation, so please feel free to contact the Advancement Office for any of your concerns.
            </p>

            <h4>Have Questions about the Advancement Office?</h4>
            <p>
            <ul style="list-style-type:circle;">
                <li>General questions? Email: Advancement@Hendrix.edu</li>
                <li>Specified project questions? Email Dan Turner</li>
                <li>If calling is more accessible, call Dan Turner</li>
            </ul>
            </p>
            <h4>Want to Make a Donation?</h4>
            <p>
                <ul style="list-style-type:circle;">
                <li><a href="https://www.hendrix.edu/give/">Click Here</a> - Or click on the Donate button in the tab!</li>
                </ul>
            </p>

            <h2>
                Making This Website
            </h2>
            <p>This Advancement Office website was made by four Computer Science students as part of the coursework for the 
                Database and Websystems course that is offered at Hendrix. With many hours of work, meetings with the Director
                of Advancement Services Dan Turner, group meetings, and peer review, we persevered through the trials of web development
                to bring you this completed website. 
            </p>
        </div>
